<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-31T00:55:30.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:55:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has deployed more than 2,000 troops to Haiti to search for four missing Salvadoran soldiers after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince, while Benin has offered a similar force to help combat gangs. Haitian gangs continue to attack civilians and the postponed presidential election is now set for July 2027 amid the violence. A hostage crisis involving Haitian captives has prompted the surge of Salvadoran forces. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNV0U2a2V6bWNlZWhPWktxYmtOTU5xWE1WU2pfVl9FMEgxakx5bXJUZFVzU0RTM195RmY1ZW1Wdk0weTMtajRfeXQxY3BlR2NpbS1fb3JCXzY5MWZxdDZMek1QcjNRWi04bmNJb3lZSjlTMERVbnZETHJZZGI5MnB4SnhycWhRR2Z3OWhSckNnSGhYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOYVd1ejRXeTFWd2ZCUTFFb1REVWtEQWFXWm9xRENBUVMzVmR3aF8yZTRKalIxVTd1NzdwYmNJUDNnZVlFXzN4RXFxV18wd0NfcDIxQ0ozZXNxaVVBbE1pY1EzWERoeDB2Tk1LSlQwOWhqdUxNckFOWlhpaFpQZl9wVkllNzk1RThBc3NyRm1CeXRwMUpCUl9FTjR6enpvWnlreGVkRkFJVVAyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5mZi1ZMi1rcS1vcTJuMEFhN1J5a2tHRy1qMXhDMTltcTdKUFdSazZNalFmNmZGMFBPbklVXzVMc2ZEV3RFVm1TNG1xOHZVQnJtbVU2Xy1WUG9SdlBSVXB0Q1RIeGt5M2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPSlNKcXRHam1PTFBqaExDOENsTlBKRE5lam9LZXVaVks2QlpENnlYVnZxYlZheUQyVWRLOU5LeGpRMFhxZzFxbndMYkJUWWROdUM5dU5fMzFsS3FNS0FtX2dVV0pWblNrd2pKMW80T1BYSVFUYVlqbTN6b0JHaWU4WmxBMGszUTVrOW81VWRXcDY5VUZYai0zUXhWa2cwUFZCdXlsSk5pYmdEZFZaMkUwLVo1YkRmb0R5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/r